[[File:TWW Grandma Holding Hero's Shield.png|right|thumb|200px|Link's Grandma presenting Link with the family Shield from {{TWW|-}}]]
The Hero's Shield is the basic [[Shield]] received at the beginning of {{TWW}}. The Shield is predominantly brown as opposed to the blue seen in {{MM|-}}. The [[Triforce]] is in the very center of the Shield. There are long swirls surrounding it as well as three bolts at its corners. A winged creature with horns replaces the bird, but unlike the {{MM|-}} version, it faces up with wings spread out like the original [[Hylian Shield]].

